{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677050/extras/b23a05696b1e66967d5d96c454cb7bf7.avif?t=1758131113\" width=1550 height=489 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Alice must have been falling for at least an hour. Or maybe longer- Alice has never been very good at keeping time. But the wind rushes in her hair, yanking at her clothes, and it's almost like she's flying. It's glorious.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Until she hits the ground.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HABROMANIA is a dreamy (or nightmarish) Alice in Wonderland-inspired RPG that follows 19-year-old Alice as she tries to escape the surreal, cozy hellscape that is Wonderland\u2014hopefully with her sanity intact. Alice wakes up at the bottom of a hole with a pounding headache and no memories of how she landed there- or memories in general, actually. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She can't remember her past, but she knows that she needs to get out of here, wherever<i> here</i> is. Guide Alice as she attempts to escape Wonderland, navigating  lush, hand-drawn environments and the socially incompetent characters who inhabit them, all with their own complex pasts and varied moral compasses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677050/extras/9efea64797483de3e83fb475f35c4976.avif?t=1758131113\" data-has-big width=1560 height=4510 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong>\u00a0immersive, maximalist environments jam-packed with interactables and collectibles, accompanied by an original OST played on an out-of-tune piano</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Choices</strong> through branching dialogue and a karma system that determines the fate of the creatures of Wonderland and Alice herself,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Very Interesting And Useful things\u00a0</strong>that aid in puzzle-solving, bartering, and uncovering the deeper lore of Wonderland and the people there</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the past</strong>\u00a0and the truth about Wonderland before Alice loses her head (or her mind)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HABROMANIA is a narrative-driven game with 12 &quot;chapters&quot; and multiple endings. Chapters will be released continuously with game updates.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677050/extras/3fb84e79e9998bd6a100306cece1eef0.avif?t=1758131113\" data-has-big width=800 height=1000 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><span class=\"bb_strike\">and remember what you did what did you do what did you do what did you do what did you do what d